Name: Midgaard~
Rooms:
  ReadingRoom:
    Description:-
         You are in a small, simple room which is mostly empty, save a few
      wooden desks and benches.  To the east you hear the bustle of the Temple
      of Midgaard, a sharp contrast to the relative quiet of this peaceful
      room.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: TempleOfMidgaard~
      ~
    Title: The Reading Room~
    ~
  TempleOfMidgaard:
    Description:-
         You are in the southern end of the temple hall in the Temple of Midgaard.
      The temple has been constructed from giant marble blocks, eternal in
      appearance, and most of the walls are covered by ancient wall paintings
      picturing Gods, Giants and peasants.
         Large steps lead down through the grand temple gate, descending the huge
      mound upon which the temple is built and ends on the temple square below.
      To the west, you see the Reading Room.  The donation room is in a small
      alcove to your east.
      ~
    Exits:
      Down: TempleSquare~
      East: MidgaardDonationRoom~
      North: ByTempleAltar~
      South: TempleSquare~
      West: ReadingRoom~
      ~
    Title: The Temple Of Midgaard~
    ~
  ClericsInnerSanctum:
    Description:-
         This is the inner sanctum.  A picture of the mighty Thor, is hanging on
      the wall, just above the altar which is set against the western wall.  A well
      in the middle of the floor leads down into darkness.  Vile smells waft from
      the depths.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: BarDivination~
      ~
    Title: The Clerics' Inner Sanctum~
    ~
  BarDivination:
    Description:-
         The bar is one of the finest in the land, lucky it is members only.  Fine
      furniture is set all around the room.  A small sign is hanging on the wall.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: EntranceClericsGuild~
      West: ClericsInnerSanctum~
      ~
    Title: The Bar Of Divination~
    ~
  EntranceClericsGuild:
    Description:-
         The entrance hall is a small modest room, reflecting the true nature of
      the Clerics.  The exit leads east to the temple square.  A small entrance to
      the bar is in the northern wall.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: TempleSquare~
      North: BarDivination~
      ~
    Title: The Entrance To The Clerics' Guild~
    ~
  TempleSquare:
    Description:-
         You are standing on the temple square.  Huge marble steps lead up to the
      temple gate.  The entrance to the Clerics' Guild is to the west, and the old
      Grunting Boar Inn, is to the east.  Just south of here you see the market
      square, the center of Midgaard.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: EntranceHallGruntingBoarInn~
      North: TempleOfMidgaard~
      South: MarketSquare~
      West: EntranceClericsGuild~
      ~
    Title: The Temple Square~
    ~
  EntranceHallGruntingBoarInn:
    Description:-
         You are standing in the entrance hall of the Grunting Boar Inn.  The hall
      has been wisely decorated with simple, functional furniture.  The heavy smell
      of dust and aging paper drifts in from the Post Office to the north.  A small
      staircase leads up to the reception and the bar is to the east.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: GruntingBoar~
      North: PostOffice~
      Up: Reception~
      West: TempleSquare~
      ~
    Title: The Entrance Hall Of The Grunting Boar Inn~
    ~
  GruntingBoar:
    Description:-
         You are standing in the bar.  The bar is set against the northern wall, old
      archaic writing, carvings and symbols cover its top.  A fireplace is built into
      the western wall, and through the southeastern windows you can see the temple
      square.  This place makes you feel like home.
      A small sign with big letters is fastened to the bar.
      ~
    Exits:
      West: EntranceHallGruntingBoarInn~
      ~
    Title: The Grunting Boar~
    ~
  Reception:
    Description:-
         You are standing in the reception.  The staircase leads down to the
      entrance hall.  An exit to the north leads to the Cryogenic Center.
      There is a small sign on the counter.
      ~
    Exits:
      Down: EntranceHallGruntingBoarInn~
      North: CryogenicCenter~
      ~
    Title: The Reception~
    ~
  Bakery:
    Description:-
         You are standing inside the small bakery.  A sweet scent of Danish and
      fine bread fills the room.  The bread and Danish are arranged in fine order
      on the shelves, and seem to be of the finest quality.
      A small sign is on the counter.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: MainStreet2~
      ~
    Title: The Bakery~
    ~
  GeneralStore:
    Description:-
         You are inside the general store.  All sorts of items are stacked on shelves
      behind the counter, safely out of your reach.
      A small note hangs on the wall.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: MainStreet3~
      ~
    Title: The General Store~
    ~
  WeaponShop:
    Description:-
         You are inside the weapon shop.  There is a small note on the counter.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: MainStreet4~
      ~
    Title: The Weapon Shop~
    ~
  MainStreet:
    Description:-
         You are at the end of the main street of Midgaard.  South of here is the
      entrance to the Guild of Magic Users.  The street continues east towards the
      market square.  The magic shop is to the north and to the west is the city
      gate.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: MainStreet2~
      North: MagicShop~
      South: EntranceMagesGuild~
      West: InsideWestGateMidgaard~
      ~
    Title: Main Street~
    ~
  MainStreet2:
    Description:-
         You are on the main street passing through the City of Midgaard.  South of
      here is the entrance to the Armory, and the bakery is to the north.  East of
      here is the market square.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: MarketSquare~
      North: Bakery~
      South: Armory~
      West: MainStreet~
      ~
    Title: Main Street~
    ~
  MarketSquare:
    Description:-
         You are standing on the market square, the famous Square of Midgaard.
      A large, peculiar looking statue is standing in the middle of the square.
      Roads lead in every direction, north to the temple square, south to the
      common square, east and westbound is the main street.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: MainStreet3~
      North: TempleSquare~
      South: CommonSquare~
      West: MainStreet2~
      ~
    Title: Market Square~
    ~
  MainStreet3:
    Description:-
         You are on the main street crossing through town.  To the north is the
      general store, and the main street continues east.  To the west you see and
      hear the market place, to the south a small door leads into the Pet Shop.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: MainStreet4~
      North: GeneralStore~
      South: PetShop~
      West: MarketSquare~
      ~
    Title: Main Street~
    ~
  MainStreet4:
    Description:-
         The main street, to the north is the weapon shop and to the south is the
      Guild of Swordsmen.  To the east you leave town and to the west the street
      leads to the market square.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: InsideEastGateMidgaard~
      North: WeaponShop~
      South: EntranceHallGuildSwordsmen~
      West: MainStreet3~
      ~
    Title: Main Street~
    ~
  EntranceMagesGuild:
    Description:-
         The entrance hall to this guild is a small, poor lighted room.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: MainStreet~
      South: MagesBar~
      ~
    Title: The Entrance To The Mages' Guild~
    ~
  MagesBar:
    Description:-
         The bar is one of the weirdest in the land.  Mystical images float around
      the air.  Illusions of fine furniture appear all around the room.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: MagesLaboratory~
      North: EntranceMagesGuild~
      ~
    Title: The Mages' Bar~
    ~
  MagesLaboratory:
    Description:-
         This is the Magical Experiments Laboratory.  Dark smoke-stained stones
      arch over numerous huge oaken tables, most of these cluttered with strange-
      looking pipes and flasks.  The floor is covered with half-erased pentagrams
      and even weirder symbols, and a blackboard in a dark corner has only been
      partially cleaned, some painful-looking letters faintly visible.  A well in
      the middle of the floor leads down into darkness.  Vile smells waft from the
      depths.
      ~
    Exits:
      West: MagesBar~
      ~
    Title: The Mages' Laboratory~
    ~
  Armory:
    Description:-
         The armory with all kinds of armors on the walls and in the window.  You
      see helmets, shields and chain mails.  To the north is the main street.
      On the wall is a small note.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: MainStreet2~
      ~
    Title: The Armory~
    ~
  EntranceHallGuildSwordsmen:
    Description:-
         The entrance hall to the Guild of Swordsmen.  A place where one has to be
      careful not to say something wrong (or right).  To the east is the bar and to
      the north is the main street.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: BarSwordsmen~
      North: MainStreet4~
      ~
    Title: The Entrance Hall To The Guild Of Swordsmen~
    ~
  BarSwordsmen:
    Description:-
         The bar of swordsmen, once upon a time beautifully furnished.  But now the
      furniture is all around you in small pieces.  To the south is the yard, and
      to the west is the entrance hall.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: TournamentPracticeYard~
      West: EntranceHallGuildSwordsmen~
      ~
    Title: The Bar Of Swordsmen~
    ~
  TournamentPracticeYard:
    Description:-
         This is the practice yard of the fighters.  To the north is the bar.
      A well leads down into darkness.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: BarSwordsmen~
      ~
    Title: The Tournament And Practice Yard~
    ~
  EasternEndPoorAlley:
    Description:-
         You are at the poor alley.  South of here is the Grubby Inn and to the
      east you see common square.  The alley continues further west.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: CommonSquare~
      South: GrubbyInn~
      West: PoorAlley~
      ~
    Title: The Eastern End Of Poor Alley~
    ~
  CommonSquare:
    Description:-
         The common square, people pass you, talking to each other.  To the west is
      the poor alley and to the east is the dark alley.  To the north, this square
      is connected to the market square.  From the south you notice a nasty smell.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: DarkAlley~
      North: MarketSquare~
      South: Dump~
      West: EasternEndPoorAlley~
      ~
    Title: The Common Square~
    ~
  DarkAlley:
    Description:-
         The dark alley, to the west is the common square and to the south is the
      Guild of Thieves.  The alley continues east.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: DarkAlleyLevee~
      South: EntranceHallGuildThieves~
      West: CommonSquare~
      ~
    Title: The Dark Alley~
    ~
  EntranceHallGuildThieves:
    Description:-
         The entrance hall to the thieves' and assassins' guild.  A place where you
      can lose both your life and your money, if you are not careful.  To the north
      is the dark alley and to the east is the thieves' bar.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: ThievesBar~
      North: DarkAlley~
      ~
    Title: The Entrance Hall To The Guild Of Thieves~
    ~
  ThievesBar:
    Description:-
         The bar of the thieves.  Once upon a time this place was beautifully
      furnished, but now it seems almost empty.  To the south is the yard, and to
      the west is the entrance hall.
         (Maybe the furniture has been stolen?!)
      ~
    Exits:
      South: SecretYard~
      West: EntranceHallGuildThieves~
      ~
    Title: The Thieves' Bar~
    ~
  SecretYard:
    Description:-
         The secret practice yard of thieves and assassins.  To the north is the
      bar.  A well leads down into darkness.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: ThievesBar~
      ~
    Title: The Secret Yard~
    ~
  Dump:
    Description:-
         The dump, where the people from the city drop their garbage.  Through the
      garbage you can see a large junction of pipes, looks like the entrance to the
      sewer system.  North of here you see the common square.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: CommonSquare~
      ~
    Title: The Dump~
    ~
  PetShop:
    Description:-
         The Pet Shop is a small crowded store, full of cages and animals of
      various sizes.  There is a sign on the wall.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: MainStreet3~
      ~
    Title: The Pet Shop~
    ~
  PetShopStore:
    Description:-
         This  is the small dark room in which the Pet shop keeps his pets.
      It is vital that this room's virtual number is exactly one larger
      than the Pet Shop number.
      ~
    Title: Pet Shop Store~
    ~
  MagicShop:
    Description:-
         Behind the counter you see various items, neatly placed in racks,
      presumably most of them are magic.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: MainStreet~
      ~
    Title: The Magic Shop~
    ~
  InsideWestGateMidgaard:
    Description:-
         You are by two small towers that have been built into the city wall and
      connected with a footbridge across the heavy wooden gate.  Main Street leads
      east and Wall Road leads south from here.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: MainStreet~
      South: WallRoad~
      West: OutsideWestGateMidgaard~
      ~
    Title: Inside The West Gate Of Midgaard~
    ~
  InsideEastGateMidgaard:
    Description:-
         You are by two small towers that have been built into the city wall and
      connected with a footbridge across the heavy wooden gate.  Main Street leads
      west from here.  To the south you see the Water Shop.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: OutsideEastGateMidgaard~
      South: YeOldeWaterShoppe~
      West: MainStreet4~
      ~
    Title: Inside The East Gate Of Midgaard~
    ~
  WallRoad:
    Description:-
         You are walking next to the western city wall.  The road continues further
      south and the city gate is just north of here.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: InsideWestGateMidgaard~
      South: WallRoad2~
      ~
    Title: Wall Road~
    ~
  WallRoad2:
    Description:-
         You are walking next to the western city wall.  Wall Road continues further
      north and south.  A small, poor alley leads east.
      Some letters have been written on the wall here.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: PoorAlley~
      North: WallRoad~
      South: WallRoad3~
      ~
    Title: Wall Road~
    ~
  PoorAlley:
    Description:-
         You are on Poor Alley, which continues further east.  You see the
      city wall to the west.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: EasternEndPoorAlley~
      West: WallRoad2~
      ~
    Title: Poor Alley~
    ~
  DarkAlleyLevee:
    Description:-
         You are standing in the alley which continues east and west.  South of
      here you see the levee.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: EasternEndAlley~
      South: Levee~
      West: DarkAlley~
      ~
    Title: The Dark Alley At The Levee~
    ~
  EasternEndAlley:
    Description:-
         You are standing at the eastern end of the alley, the city wall is just
      east, blocking any further movement.  A small warehouse is directly south of
      here.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: DesertedWarehouse~
      West: DarkAlleyLevee~
      ~
    Title: The Eastern End Of The Alley~
    ~
  WallRoad3:
    Description:-
         You are standing on the road next to the western city wall, which
      continues north.  South of here is a bridge across the river.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: WallRoad2~
      South: OnBridge~
      ~
    Title: Wall Road~
    ~
  GrubbyInn:
    Description:-
         You are inside the old Grubby Inn.  This place has not been cleaned for
      several decades; vile smells make you dizzy.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: EasternEndPoorAlley~
      ~
    Title: Grubby Inn~
    ~
  Levee:
    Description:-
         You are at the levee.  South of here you see the river gently flowing west.
      The river bank is very low making it possible to enter the river.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: DarkAlleyLevee~
      South: OnRiver3~
      ~
    Title: The Levee~
    ~
  DesertedWarehouse:
    Description:-
         You are inside the warehouse.  The room is decorated with various old
      items from ships.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: EasternEndAlley~
      ~
    Title: The Deserted Warehouse~
    ~
  OnBridge:
    Description:-
         You are standing on the stone bridge crosses the river.  The bridge is
      built out from the western city wall and the river flows west through an
      opening in the wall ten feet below the bridge.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: WallRoad3~
      South: NorthwestEndConcourse~
      ~
    Title: On The Bridge~
    ~
  OutsideWestGateMidgaard:
    Description:-
         You are by two small towers that have been built into the city wall and
      connected with a footbridge across the heavy wooden gate.  To the west you
      can see the edge of a big forest.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: InsideWestGateMidgaard~
      ~
    Title: Outside The West Gate Of Midgaard~
    ~
  OutsideEastGateMidgaard:
    Description:-
         You are by two small towers that have been built into the city wall and
      connected with a footbridge across the heavy wooden gate.  To the east the
      plains stretch out in the distance.
      ~
    Exits:
      West: InsideEastGateMidgaard~
      ~
    Title: Outside The East Gate Of Midgaard~
    ~
  ByTempleAltar:
    Description:-
         You are by the temple altar in the northern end of the Temple of
      Midgaard.  A huge altar made from white polished marble is standing
      in front of you and behind it is a ten foot tall sitting statue of
      Odin, the King of the Gods.
         To the north, steps lead out the back of the temple towards the
      countryside.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: BehindTempleAltar~
      South: TempleOfMidgaard~
      ~
    Title: By The Temple Altar~
    ~
  OdinsStore:
    Description:-
         This is the small dark room in which Odin keeps the player items that he
      takes care of.  It is vital that this room's virtual number is exactly one
      larger than the room by the temple altar.
      ~
    Title: Odin's Store~
    ~
  YeOldeWaterShoppe:
    Description:-
         You are standing in the center of a small wooden shop whose walls are
      covered with racks upon racks of water jugs.  Several large barrels with
      spigots are stacked in the corner.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: InsideEastGateMidgaard~
      ~
    Title: Ye Olde Water Shoppe~
    ~
  BehindTempleAltar:
    Description:-
         You are on a dirt path leading away from the Temple Altar which is south
      of here.  To the north, the path continues through the lush contryside of
      Midgaard towards the Dragonhelm Mountains far off to the north.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: GreatFieldMidgaard~
      South: ByTempleAltar~
      ~
    Title: Behind The Temple Altar~
    ~
  GreatFieldMidgaard:
    Description:-
         You are walking on a wide dirt path through the lush, green, fresh
      Midgaard countryside.  You can see to the horizon to the north, east,
      and west; the busy city of Midgaard lies to the south.  All around you
      is healthy green grass and an occasional large oak tree.  The sun feels
      wonderful on your face and a pleasant wind blows through your hair.  Birds
      chirp quietly to themselves and you can smell the faint scent of flowers
      and freshly cut grass.  You feel like you could lie down in the grass and
      stay here forever, surrounded by powerful beauty in all directions.
         The path you are on continues north through the field and south back
      to Midgaard.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: GreatFieldMidgaard2~
      South: BehindTempleAltar~
      ~
    Title: The Great Field Of Midgaard~
    ~
  GreatFieldMidgaard2:
    Description:-
         You are walking on a wide dirt path through the lush, green, fresh
      Midgaard countryside.  You can see to the horizon to the north, east,
      and west; the busy city of Midgaard lies to the south.  All around you
      is healthy green grass and an occasional large oak tree.  The sun feels
      wonderful on your face and a pleasant wind blows through your hair.  Birds
      chirp quietly to themselves and you can smell the faint scent of flowers
      and freshly cut grass.  You feel like you could lie down in the grass and
      stay here forever, surrounded by powerful beauty in all directions.
         There is a strange structure on the eastern side of the path.  A small
      dirt path splits off of the main path and leads off to the west.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: GreatFieldMidgaard3~
      South: GreatFieldMidgaard~
      West: DirtPath~
      ~
    Title: The Great Field Of Midgaard~
    ~
  PostOffice:
    Description:-
         You are in the central post office for Midgaard.  Piles of assorted mail
      lay untouched in the corners, collecting cobwebs.  Several large crates have
      been pried open by curious customs agents, and are now stacked along the west
      wall, hiding plenty of 'WANTED' posters.
      There is a sign posted on the wall here.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: EntranceHallGruntingBoarInn~
      ~
    Title: The Post Office~
    ~
  MidgaardDonationRoom:
    Description:-
         You are in a small, undecorated room just off of the main temple.  There
      are a couple of small wooden benches here where people occasionally sit
      while they wait for items to appear.  The temple is to the west.
      ~
    Exits:
      West: TempleOfMidgaard~
      ~
    Title: The Midgaard Donation Room~
    ~
  CryogenicCenter:
    Description:-
         You are standing in an impossible white sterile room with cylindrical
      body-length canisters lined up against the walls.  The Reception is to the
      south.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: Reception~
      ~
    Title: The Cryogenic Center~
    ~
  GreatFieldMidgaard3:
    Description:-
         You are walking on a wide dirt path through the lush, green, fresh
      Midgaard countryside.  You can see to the horizon to the north, east,
      and west; the busy city of Midgaard lies to the south.  All around you
      is healthy green grass and an occasional large oak tree.  The sun feels
      wonderful on your face and a pleasant wind blows through your hair.  Birds
      chirp quietly to themselves and you can smell the faint scent of flowers
      and freshly cut grass.  You feel like you could lie down in the grass and
      stay here forever, surrounded by powerful beauty in all directions.
         The way north appears to be blocked by a large plot device and you cannot
      see any way around it.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: GreatFieldMidgaard2~
      ~
    Title: The Great Field Of Midgaard~
    ~
  DirtPath:
    Description:-
         You are walking along a narrow dirt path through the lush, green,
      fresh Midgaard countryside.  You can see to the horizon to the north
      and east; the busy city of Midgaard lies to the south.  All around
      you is healthy green grass and an occasional large oak tree.  The sun
      feels wonderful on your face and a pleasant wind blows through your
      hair.  Birds chirp quietly to themselves and you can smell the faint
      scent of flowers and freshly cut grass.  You feel like you could lie
      down in the grass and stay here forever, surrounded by powerful beauty
      in all directions.
         There is a large rusty gate sitting in a stone archway just to the
      west.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: GreatFieldMidgaard2~
      ~
    Title: The Dirt Path~
    ~
  NorthwestEndConcourse:
    Description:-
         You are at the concourse, the city wall is just west.  A small promenade
      goes east, and the bridge is just north of here.  The concourse continues
      south along the city wall.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: Promenade~
      North: OnBridge~
      South: OnConcourse~
      ~
    Title: The Northwest End Of The Concourse~
    ~
  Promenade:
    Description:-
         The river gently flows westwards just north of here.  The promenade
      continues further east and to the west you see the city wall.  Park Road
      leads south from here.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: Promenade2~
      South: ParkRoad5~
      West: NorthwestEndConcourse~
      ~
    Title: The Promenade~
    ~
  Promenade2:
    Description:-
         The river gently flows westwards just north of here.  The promenade
      continues both east and west.  South of here you see the entrance to
      the park, and a small building seems to be just west of the entrance.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: Promenade3~
      South: ParkEntrance~
      West: Promenade~
      ~
    Title: The Promenade~
    ~
  Promenade3:
    Description:-
         The river gently flows westwards just north of here.  The promenade
      continues both east and west.  A small path leads south.  Looking across
      the river you see the levee.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: NortheastEndConcourse~
      South: EmeraldAvenue5~
      West: Promenade2~
      ~
    Title: The Promenade~
    ~
  NortheastEndConcourse:
    Description:-
         You are at the Concourse.  The city wall is just east and a small
      promenade goes west.  Looking across the river you see a building that
      resembles a warehouse.  The Concourse continues south along the city
      wall.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: OnConcourse4~
      West: Promenade3~
      ~
    Title: The Northeast End Of The Concourse~
    ~
  ParkEntrance:
    Description:-
         You are standing just inside the small park of Midgaard.  To the north is
      the promenade and a small path leads south into the park.  To your east is
      the famous Park Cafe.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: ParkCafe~
      North: Promenade2~
      South: SmallPathPark2~
      ~
    Title: The Park Entrance~
    ~
  ParkCafe:
    Description:-
         You are inside Park Cafe, a very cozy place with many tables and
      seats where you can relax and enjoy the view.  To the east you can
      see the entrance to the park.
      ~
    Exits:
      West: ParkEntrance~
      ~
    Title: Park Cafe~
    ~
  SmallPathPark:
    Description:-
         You are walking along a small path through the park.  The path continues
      south and east.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: SmallPathPark2~
      South: PathPark~
      ~
    Title: A Small Path In The Park~
    ~
  SmallPathPark2:
    Description:-
         You are standing on a small path inside the park.  The park entrance is
      just north of here, and Park Cafe is just east of the entrance.  The path
      leads further east and west.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: SmallPathPark3~
      North: ParkEntrance~
      West: SmallPathPark~
      ~
    Title: A Small Path In The Park~
    ~
  SmallPathPark3:
    Description:-
         You are on a small path running through the park.  It continues west and
      south and just north of here you see the southern wall of Park Cafe.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: PathPark2~
      West: SmallPathPark2~
      ~
    Title: A Small Path In The Park~
    ~
  CityguardHeadquarters:
    Description:-
         You are inside a tidy office.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: ParkRoad~
      ~
    Title: Cityguard HeadQuarters~
    ~
  ParkRoad:
    Description:-
         The road continues north and south.  A building is just west of here, you
      notice a sign on the door.  The park entrance is to the east.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: WesternParkEntrance~
      North: ParkRoad5~
      South: ParkRoad2~
      West: CityguardHeadquarters~
      ~
    Title: Park Road~
    ~
  WesternParkEntrance:
    Description:-
         You are standing at the western end of the park.  A small path leads east
      into the park and going west through the entrance you will reach Park Road.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: PathPark~
      West: ParkRoad~
      ~
    Title: The Western Park Entrance~
    ~
  PathPark:
    Description:-
         You are in the park.  The paths lead north and west.  Westward is the
      park entrance and to the east you see a small pond.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: Pond~
      North: SmallPathPark~
      West: WesternParkEntrance~
      ~
    Title: A Path In The Park~
    ~
  Pond:
    Description:-
         You are swimming around in the pond, feeling rather stupid.  You can get
      back on the path from the eastern and western end of the pond.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: PathPark2~
      West: PathPark~
      ~
    Title: The Pond~
    ~
  PathPark2:
    Description:-
         You are in the park.  The paths lead north and east.  Eastward is the
      park entrance and to the west you see a small pond.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: EasternParkEntrance~
      North: SmallPathPark3~
      West: Pond~
      ~
    Title: A Path In The Park~
    ~
  EasternParkEntrance:
    Description:-
         You are standing at the eastern end of the park.  A small path leads west
      into the park.  Going east through the entrance you will reach Emerald
      Avenue.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: EmeraldAvenue~
      West: PathPark2~
      ~
    Title: The Eastern Park Entrance~
    ~
  EmeraldAvenue:
    Description:-
         You are standing on the north end of Emerald Avenue.  To the north is the
      promenade and to the west is the park entrance.  To the east is the not very
      big Town Hall of Midgaard.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: WaitingRoom~
      North: EmeraldAvenue5~
      South: EmeraldAvenue2~
      West: EasternParkEntrance~
      ~
    Title: Emerald Avenue~
    ~
  ParkRoad2:
    Description:-
         You are on Park Road which leads north and south.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: ParkRoad~
      South: ParkRoad6~
      ~
    Title: Park Road~
    ~
  EmeraldAvenue2:
    Description:-
         You are standing at a bend on Emerald Avenue.  The road leads north and
      west.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: EmeraldAvenue~
      West: EmeraldAvenue6~
      ~
    Title: Emerald Avenue~
    ~
  RoadCrossing:
    Description:-
         You are in the middle of the road cross.  Roads lead in all directions.
      A huge black iron chain as thick as a tree trunk is fastened into the ground
      at the center of the road cross.  Its other end leads directly upwards towards
      the sky.
      A road sign is here.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: ParkRoad7~
      North: EmeraldAvenue6~
      South: EmeraldAvenue7~
      West: ParkRoad6~
      ~
    Title: The Road Crossing~
    ~
  EmeraldAvenue3:
    Description:-
         You are standing at a bend on Emerald Avenue.  The road leads south and
      east.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: EmeraldAvenue7~
      South: EmeraldAvenue4~
      ~
    Title: Emerald Avenue~
    ~
  ParkRoad3:
    Description:-
         You are on Park Road which leads south and north.  Elm Street is east of
      here.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: ElmStreet~
      North: ParkRoad7~
      South: ParkRoad4~
      ~
    Title: Park Road~
    ~
  ElmStreet:
    Description:-
         You are on Elm street.  Park Road is to the west and Elm Street continues
      in eastward direction.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: EndElmStreet~
      West: ParkRoad3~
      ~
    Title: Elm Street~
    ~
  EndElmStreet:
    Description:-
         You are at the end of Elm Street.
      ~
    Exits:
      West: ElmStreet~
      ~
    Title: The End Of Elm Street~
    ~
  EmeraldAvenue4:
    Description:-
         You are on Emerald Avenue which continues north.  The Concourse is south
      of here.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: EmeraldAvenue3~
      South: OnConcourse2~
      ~
    Title: Emerald Avenue~
    ~
  ParkRoad4:
    Description:-
         You are on Park Road which continues north.  The Concourse is south of
      here.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: ParkRoad3~
      South: OnConcourse3~
      ~
    Title: Park Road~
    ~
  OnConcourse:
    Description:-
         You are at the southwest corner of the city wall.  The Concourse leads
      both north and east.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: OnConcourse2~
      North: NorthwestEndConcourse~
      ~
    Title: On The Concourse~
    ~
  OnConcourse2:
    Description:-
         The Concourse continues both east and west.  Emerald Avenue is north of
      here.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: OnConcourse3~
      North: EmeraldAvenue4~
      West: OnConcourse~
      ~
    Title: On The Concourse~
    ~
  OnConcourse3:
    Description:-
         The Concourse continues both east and west.  Park Road is north of here
      and an iron grate leads south to the graveyard.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: OnConcourse4~
      North: ParkRoad4~
      South: GravelRoadGraveyard~
      West: OnConcourse2~
      ~
    Title: On The Concourse~
    ~
  OnConcourse4:
    Description:-
         You are at the southeast corner of the city wall.  The Concourse leads
      both north and west.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: NortheastEndConcourse~
      West: OnConcourse3~
      ~
    Title: On The Concourse~
    ~
  ParkRoad5:
    Description:-
         You are at Park Road which continues north and south.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: Promenade~
      South: ParkRoad~
      ~
    Title: Park Road~
    ~
  EmeraldAvenue5:
    Description:-
         You are at Emerald Avenue which continues north and south.  Penny Lane leads
      east from here.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: PennyLane~
      North: Promenade3~
      South: EmeraldAvenue~
      ~
    Title: Emerald Avenue~
    ~
  EmeraldAvenue6:
    Description:-
         You are standing at a bend on Emerald Avenue.  To the east the road goes on
      and to the south is the Road Crossing.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: EmeraldAvenue2~
      South: RoadCrossing~
      ~
    Title: Emerald Avenue~
    ~
  EmeraldAvenue7:
    Description:-
         You are standing at a bend on Emerald Avenue.  To the west the road goes on
      and to the north is the Road Crossing.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: RoadCrossing~
      West: EmeraldAvenue3~
      ~
    Title: Emerald Avenue~
    ~
  ParkRoad6:
    Description:-
         You are at a bend on Park Road.  To the north the road goes on and to the
      east is the Road Crossing.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: RoadCrossing~
      North: ParkRoad2~
      ~
    Title: Park Road~
    ~
  ParkRoad7:
    Description:-
         You are at a bend on Park Road.  To the south the road goes on and to the
      west is the Road Crossing.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: ParkRoad3~
      West: RoadCrossing~
      ~
    Title: Park Road~
    ~
  WaitingRoom:
    Description:-
         You are standing in the waiting room at the town hall.  Wooden chairs stand
      along the walls and a long desk with a typewriter is placed in the middle of
      the room.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: MayorsOffice~
      West: EmeraldAvenue~
      ~
    Title: The Waiting Room~
    ~
  MayorsOffice:
    Description:-
         You are in the not very big office of the Mayor of Midgaard.  A large and
      polished but completely empty desk is standing in front of an armchair that
      looks so comfortable that it most of all resembles a bed with the head end
      raised slightly.
      ~
    Exits:
      West: WaitingRoom~
      ~
    Title: The Mayor's Office~
    ~
  PennyLane:
    Description:-
         You are on Penny Lane.  Emerald Avenue is to the west and Penny Lane
      continues in eastward direction.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: PennyLane2~
      West: EmeraldAvenue5~
      ~
    Title: Penny Lane~
    ~
  PennyLane2:
    Description:-
         You are on Penny Lane.  The narrow road continues north and west.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: EndPennyLane~
      West: PennyLane~
      ~
    Title: Penny Lane~
    ~
  EndPennyLane:
    Description:-
         You are at the end of Penny Lane.  The only exit appears to be south.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: PennyLane2~
      ~
    Title: The End Of Penny Lane~
    ~
  GravelRoadGraveyard:
    Description:-
         You are on a well-kept gravel road that leads north-south through the
      graveyard.  On both sides of the road grow dark evergreen trees.  An iron
      grate is to the north.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: OnConcourse3~
      South: GravelRoadGraveyard2~
      ~
    Title: A Gravel Road In The Graveyard~
    ~
  GravelRoadGraveyard2:
    Description:-
        You are on a well-kept gravel road that leads north-south through the
      graveyard.  On both sides of the road grow dark evergreen trees.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: GravelRoadGraveyard~
      South: GravelRoadGraveyard3~
      ~
    Title: A Gravel Road In The Graveyard~
    ~
  GravelRoadGraveyard3:
    Description:-
        You are on a well-kept gravel road that leads north-south through the
      graveyard.  On both sides of the road grow dark evergreen trees.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: GravelRoadGraveyard2~
      South: GravelRoadGraveyard4~
      ~
    Title: A Gravel Road In The Graveyard~
    ~
  GravelRoadGraveyard4:
    Description:-
        You are on a well-kept gravel road that leads north-south through the
      graveyard.  On both sides of the road grow dark evergreen trees.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: GravelRoadGraveyard3~
      South: FrontChapel~
      ~
    Title: A Gravel Road In The Graveyard~
    ~
  FrontChapel:
    Description:-
         You are on an open space before a small chapel.  A gravel road leads north
      through the graveyard and the chapel entrance is to the south.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: GravelRoadGraveyard4~
      South: InsideChapel~
      ~
    Title: In Front Of The Chapel~
    ~
  InsideChapel:
    Description:-
         You are in a small, dark chapel.  The dark brown glass in the tiny windows
      do not let much light through.  A few rows of worn wooden benches stand here
      and an ancient altar sits in the middle of the floor.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: FrontChapel~
      ~
    Title: Inside The Chapel~
    ~
  UnderBridge:
    Description:-
         The arch under the bridge is covered by seaweed about a foot above the
      surface of the river.  The water gently flows through an opening in the lower
      part of the city wall.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: OnRiver~
      ~
    Title: Under The Bridge~
    ~
  OnRiver:
    Description:-
         North of here you see the miserable buildings of Poor Alley.  The
      river flows west towards the bridge.  The riverbanks are too steep to
      climb.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: OnRiver2~
      West: UnderBridge~
      ~
    Title: On The River~
    ~
  OnRiver2:
    Description:-
         North of here you see the dump.  The river flows from east to west.  The
      riverbanks are too steep to climb.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: OnRiver3~
      West: OnRiver~
      ~
    Title: On The River~
    ~
  OnRiver3:
    Description:-
         The levee is directly north of here.  The river flows in an east west
      direction.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: OnRiver4~
      North: Levee~
      West: OnRiver2~
      ~
    Title: On The River~
    ~
  OnRiver4:
    Description:-
         You see the warehouse on the northern riverbank.  East of here you see the
      city wall.  The river flows west towards the levee.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: OnRiver5~
      West: OnRiver3~
      ~
    Title: On The River~
    ~
  OnRiver5:
    Description:-
         The river enters from a hole in the eastern city wall.  The hole has been
      blocked by several vertically positioned iron bars set into the wall.
      ~
    Exits:
      West: OnRiver4~
      ~
    Title: On The River~
    ~
  ~
~
